(5588149, 808790, 70369, '<td valign="top">the hills are alive, with the sound of music.. All you need is Julie Andrews at the top of the hill..:-) This is just my personal opinion, and not a popular one, but I think some guassian blur, then drop the opacity down to about 30%.. This would take away some of the harshness I see.. 6</td>', 'the hills are alive, with the sound of music.. All you need is Julie Andrews at the top of the hill..:-) This is just my personal opinion, and not a popular one, but I think some guassian blur, then drop the opacity down to about 30%.. This would take away some of the harshness I see.. 6', '2009-07-27 17:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5588152, 808561, 70369, '<td valign="top">hmmm.. it''s a tree.. nice dramatic sky in the background.. I think I would like this more if it wasn''t such a tight crop.. maybe a little more use of the rule of thirds would make it more appealing.. It''s just kinda a tree and nothing else.. imho.. 5</td>', 'hmmm.. it''s a tree.. nice dramatic sky in the background.. I think I would like this more if it wasn''t such a tight crop.. maybe a little more use of the rule of thirds would make it more appealing.. It''s just kinda a tree and nothing else.. imho.. 5', '2009-07-27 17:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
