(5591757, 808557, 83313, '<td valign="top">I had a case of it about a year ago after pulling some weeds. No fun at all. The photo is fairly flat and plain, I''m afraid. I did play with it a bit, and found that some adjustments (curves, Topaz adjust, sharpening) gave it a bit more visual pop.</td>', 'I had a case of it about a year ago after pulling some weeds. No fun at all. The photo is fairly flat and plain, I''m afraid. I did play with it a bit, and found that some adjustments (curves, Topaz adjust, sharpening) gave it a bit more visual pop.', '2009-07-30 14:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5591761, 809757, 83313, '<td valign="top">Now THAT looks like fun! Comes off as an average snapshot, I''m afraid, but still fun.</td>', 'Now THAT looks like fun! Comes off as an average snapshot, I''m afraid, but still fun.', '2009-07-30 14:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5591762, 809759, 83313, '<td valign="top">As I said already, I think this was the more creative choice, and I like it. Nice use of negative space. There are some dark pixelated areas showing in the upper corners, but it is probably not visible on many monitors. (No vote, comment only)</td>', 'As I said already, I think this was the more creative choice, and I like it. Nice use of negative space. There are some dark pixelated areas showing in the upper corners, but it is probably not visible on many monitors. (No vote, comment only)', '2009-07-30 14:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
