(5592578, 808418, 52472, '<td valign="top">Your composition is great (even the clouds are exactly where they should be). You have three strong colors, perfect! And the subject is interesting, makes me dream. I really like it (8). You have everything in there for a top picture, except the DPC-worshiped super sharpness and contrast, I think.</td>', 'Your composition is great (even the clouds are exactly where they should be). You have three strong colors, perfect! And the subject is interesting, makes me dream. I really like it (8). You have everything in there for a top picture, except the DPC-worshiped super sharpness and contrast, I think.', '2009-07-31 12:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5592586, 809756, 52472, '<td valign="top">Too much fingers (tough subject!) and not enough of these gorgeous colors (needles &amp; knitting). I am sure this is real knitting in action, but for a photo one could twist reality a bit for a nicer pose/composition.</td>', 'Too much fingers (tough subject!) and not enough of these gorgeous colors (needles & knitting). I am sure this is real knitting in action, but for a photo one could twist reality a bit for a nicer pose/composition.', '2009-07-31 13:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5592595, 809493, 52472, '<td valign="top">What''s the most important feature in portraits? The eyes<br/> <br/>Your picture just made me realize that the most important feature in spider-portraits is the hair. Which looks fantastic here!<br/> <br/>But for stated reasons the eyes are distracting here. Probably because they feel a bit unnatural with their green highlights. (Of course I have no idea what they actually should look like!)</td>', 'What''s the most important feature in portraits? The eyes Your picture just made me realize that the most important feature in spider-portraits is the hair. Which looks fantastic here! But for stated reasons the eyes are distracting here. Probably because they feel a bit unnatural with their green highlights. (Of course I have no idea what they actually should look like!)', '2009-07-31 13:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5592598, 809666, 83313, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract. There is no real subject and that IS the subject. It''s probably just some splattered paint on the wall, but to me, it looks like a storm over a sand dune in the desert. I am guessing this will not score highly overall, but I like a lot of these sort of images.</td>', 'Interesting abstract. There is no real subject and that IS the subject. It''s probably just some splattered paint on the wall, but to me, it looks like a storm over a sand dune in the desert. I am guessing this will not score highly overall, but I like a lot of these sort of images.', '2009-07-31 13:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
