(5596762, 809786, 74588, '<td valign="top">to be looked at,talked about,discussed<br/>by countless future generations<br/></td>', 'to be looked at,talked about,discussedby countless future generations', '2009-08-03 10:34:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(5596791, 809676, 87808, '<td valign="top">Hello from the Critique Club!!<br/> <br/>This is so funny, I showed it to my kids and they are giggling now too!!<br/> <br/>I think you did really well to get to this shot, I was impressed that the cat was actually looking at it upside down and you had not just flipped it.  There is a lack of sharpness on the cats head, maybe a tweak or two with sharpening  and saturations in post processing could have made a little bit of a difference. <br/> <br/>The black border is very heavy, but it really works for this shot. Bumping up the ISO would have helped as well, bu that can be hard when you are catching a moment like this. <br/> <br/>I can not wait to see it when you get fish in and hopefully the cat will be even more interested and we will see some more amazing shots<br/> <br/></td>', 'Hello from the Critique Club!! This is so funny, I showed it to my kids and they are giggling now too!! I think you did really well to get to this shot, I was impressed that the cat was actually looking at it upside down and you had not just flipped it.  There is a lack of sharpness on the cats head, maybe a tweak or two with sharpening  and saturations in post processing could have made a little bit of a difference.  The black border is very heavy, but it really works for this shot. Bumping up the ISO would have helped as well, bu that can be hard when you are catching a moment like this.  I can not wait to see it when you get fish in and hopefully the cat will be even more interested and we will see some more amazing shots ', '2009-08-03 10:46:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(5596796, 809621, 63244, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love your shots like this. It is so dreamy and just beautiful! Congrats, Robert, on a blue for a truly lovely photograph. Going into my faves!!</td>', 'I absolutely love your shots like this. It is so dreamy and just beautiful! Congrats, Robert, on a blue for a truly lovely photograph. Going into my faves!!', '2009-08-03 10:53:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(5596797, 808878, 87808, '<td valign="top">Hello from the Critique Club!!<br/> <br/>Well, wow what can I say, this has to be the most handsome Rooster I have ever seen. <br/> <br/>An amazing job on the exposure, I do not think that the whites are blown out, Roosters tend to have very shiny feathers and you have caught all the details in them.  The sharpening is excellent, there is a very small halo of white ringing the red, but it is hardly noticeable. <br/> <br/>The top may have been cropped just a little more.  The border choice was a good one. You used every single inch of your 720 allowance. DOF is very good. <br/> <br/>Overall this is an excellent shot and placed very well.</td>', 'Hello from the Critique Club!! Well, wow what can I say, this has to be the most handsome Rooster I have ever seen.  An amazing job on the exposure, I do not think that the whites are blown out, Roosters tend to have very shiny feathers and you have caught all the details in them.  The sharpening is excellent, there is a very small halo of white ringing the red, but it is hardly noticeable.  The top may have been cropped just a little more.  The border choice was a good one. You used every single inch of your 720 allowance. DOF is very good.  Overall this is an excellent shot and placed very well.', '2009-08-03 10:55:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(5596803, 809621, 98339, '<td valign="top">Good for you Robert...Excellent picture...well deserved...</td>', 'Good for you Robert...Excellent picture...well deserved...', '2009-08-03 11:00:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(5596804, 809621, 36999, '<td valign="top">Congrats Bear!  beautiful image.</td>', 'Congrats Bear!  beautiful image.', '2009-08-03 11:01:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(5596805, 809623, 77196, '<td valign="top">Huh? I don''t see any possible way this deserves a bottom 10 finish. You''re using nice bokah for the background, fairly even lighting on the face, no hot spots on the glasses, nit-picks (and they are that) - light spot on his left forehead, lower portion of tie is a bit washed out color-wise. I may have tried a crop through his right shoulder (red background side), so he anchors the picture with his head / body, and is looking into negative space (which, if there is room in your original a bit more would be better). I have no clue who the man is, but it looks like he is a reporter for CNN, or is giving a statement to CNN. I even like his slightly bemused expression that you caught. <br/></td>', 'Huh? I don''t see any possible way this deserves a bottom 10 finish. You''re using nice bokah for the background, fairly even lighting on the face, no hot spots on the glasses, nit-picks (and they are that) - light spot on his left forehead, lower portion of tie is a bit washed out color-wise. I may have tried a crop through his right shoulder (red background side), so he anchors the picture with his head / body, and is looking into negative space (which, if there is room in your original a bit more would be better). I have no clue who the man is, but it looks like he is a reporter for CNN, or is giving a statement to CNN. I even like his slightly bemused expression that you caught. ', '2009-08-03 11:01:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(5596811, 809528, 98339, '<td valign="top">Very well done!!!  I saw this and thought of you!!!  One of our favorites I am sure...not sure if it is Portland Head or Cape Niddick Lighthouse...but an excellent choice for sure...</td>', 'Very well done!!!  I saw this and thought of you!!!  One of our favorites I am sure...not sure if it is Portland Head or Cape Niddick Lighthouse...but an excellent choice for sure...', '2009-08-03 11:05:02.000000', NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5596812, 809122, 67697, '<td valign="top"><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=50641" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">skewsme</a> was my second guess... :)</td>', ' skewsme was my second guess... :)', '2009-08-03 11:06:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(5596819, 809621, 91342, '<td valign="top">Robert -- A gorgeous shot.  Looks like a Wianno Sr.  I owned #5 in the 70s when living in Falmouth.  jean</td>', 'Robert -- A gorgeous shot.  Looks like a Wianno Sr.  I owned #5 in the 70s when living in Falmouth.  jean', '2009-08-03 11:11:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(5596820, 808782, 87808, '<td valign="top">Critique Club!<br/> <br/>What an amazing view you have and obviously some strong legs to take you there. <br/> <br/>I love this shot, you choose so well, the quietness of the mountain overlooking the hectic busy metropolitan of life. I think putting your bag on the other side of you would have looked artistically better. <br/> <br/>The placement of you in the shot, is well chosen.  The details are really brought out by your sharpening.  The grass is a little over sharpened though but does not distract from the shot at all.  In post processing , a little dodge and burn on the mountains could have brought them out a bit.  They seem a little flat, so making the darks a little darker would have made them pop out. Good job on getting the white balance corrected in pp. <br/> <br/>Overall, a very good photo. <br/></td>', 'Critique Club! What an amazing view you have and obviously some strong legs to take you there.  I love this shot, you choose so well, the quietness of the mountain overlooking the hectic busy metropolitan of life. I think putting your bag on the other side of you would have looked artistically better.  The placement of you in the shot, is well chosen.  The details are really brought out by your sharpening.  The grass is a little over sharpened though but does not distract from the shot at all.  In post processing , a little dodge and burn on the mountains could have brought them out a bit.  They seem a little flat, so making the darks a little darker would have made them pop out. Good job on getting the white balance corrected in pp.  Overall, a very good photo. ', '2009-08-03 11:11:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(5596823, 809513, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh, I am SO HONORED to have such a classy beautiful work of fine art representing my username :)   You''re the BOMB!</td>', 'Oh, I am SO HONORED to have such a classy beautiful work of fine art representing my username :)   You''re the BOMB!', '2009-08-03 11:15:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(5596825, 808919, 24454, '<td valign="top">Jennifer, this is so amazing.  It has that Jennifer Short Magic in every way.  It makes my heart feel all mushy just looking at it -- which I have enjoyed doing for what seems like forever!<br/></td>', 'Jennifer, this is so amazing.  It has that Jennifer Short Magic in every way.  It makes my heart feel all mushy just looking at it -- which I have enjoyed doing for what seems like forever!', '2009-08-03 11:19:03.000000', NULL, 0),
