(5596868, 809721, 100301, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LadyK:</b></div><hr/><i> bahaha, i cant beleive you did worse then me! awesome:) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Bite me!  HA!  But the beauty of it is I got like third from the bottom with only two 1''s.  That''s impressive!  Oh well, last week was a personal best, this week was a worst.</td>', 'Originally posted by LadyK: bahaha, i cant beleive you did worse then me! awesome:)   Bite me!  HA!  But the beauty of it is I got like third from the bottom with only two 1''s.  That''s impressive!  Oh well, last week was a personal best, this week was a worst.', '2009-08-03 11:41:01.000000', NULL, 0),
