(5596872, 808919, 69668, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> This is so touching.<br/> <br/>I have another ribbon-winner but I can''t resist this photo, so I''m going to give out 2 yellows. My Posthumous Yellow Ribbon for you.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/> </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Well my goodness!!!!  I never thought in a million years that I would receive one of these.  Thanks so much!!!</td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous: This is so touching. I have another ribbon-winner but I can''t resist this photo, so I''m going to give out 2 yellows. My Posthumous Yellow Ribbon for you.    Well my goodness!!!!  I never thought in a million years that I would receive one of these.  Thanks so much!!!', '2009-08-03 11:43:08.000000', NULL, 0),
