(5597039, 808741, 14476, '<td valign="top">Hey, Joe.  I wondered who had been out to the Lighthouse.  Nice job, for sure.<br/> <br/>They also have ''moonlight'' escorted visits several times a year.  It is especially spectacular around Sept/oct when you can easily photograph both that big moon rising and also the sunset  weather permitting, of course.<br/>Check the Marin Headlands website or I can inquire of a photographer I know who sometimes leads the walks.  <br/> <br/>Alice</td>', 'Hey, Joe.  I wondered who had been out to the Lighthouse.  Nice job, for sure. They also have ''moonlight'' escorted visits several times a year.  It is especially spectacular around Sept/oct when you can easily photograph both that big moon rising and also the sunset  weather permitting, of course.Check the Marin Headlands website or I can inquire of a photographer I know who sometimes leads the walks.   Alice', '2009-08-03 13:40:17.000000', NULL, 0),
