(5597544, 808919, 30861, '<td valign="top">I''m really sorry to hear about the time/date fiasco. I had one of those on my highest-scoring image (at that time), just after I had bought the 20D. The store had set the time/date and it was exactly 12 hours off. As it happened, I shot the winning picture at dawn on Monday, so naturally the stamp showed it to be at sunset on Sunday, before the challenge was announced :-(<br/> <br/>At least you have the Posthumous for this one (he doesn''t care about the date stamp), and you didn''t lose a ribbon, so I guess that helps?<br/> <br/>Still a wonderful shot!</td>', 'I''m really sorry to hear about the time/date fiasco. I had one of those on my highest-scoring image (at that time), just after I had bought the 20D. The store had set the time/date and it was exactly 12 hours off. As it happened, I shot the winning picture at dawn on Monday, so naturally the stamp showed it to be at sunset on Sunday, before the challenge was announced :-( At least you have the Posthumous for this one (he doesn''t care about the date stamp), and you didn''t lose a ribbon, so I guess that helps? Still a wonderful shot!', '2009-08-03 20:30:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(5597553, 809448, 20364, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by colorcarnival:</b></div><hr/><i> lol well I am sorry to see it finished so low.  Great try tho - and it looks like some enjoyed it :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thanks very much.  I am happy some liked it.  I really like your username and felt that it would be the best one to shoot for.  This photo is of my daughter and she IS crazy!</td>', 'Originally posted by colorcarnival: lol well I am sorry to see it finished so low.  Great try tho - and it looks like some enjoyed it :)  Thanks very much.  I am happy some liked it.  I really like your username and felt that it would be the best one to shoot for.  This photo is of my daughter and she IS crazy!', '2009-08-03 20:39:32.000000', NULL, 0),
