(5601735, 809623, 29486, '<td valign="top">This is defintely not a Bottom 10 finish but this is DPC and I''m determined to continue to enter images that meet the challenge and fight for that coveted Brown Ribbon! I''ve come close the last few challenges. I knew this wouldn''t score well as in 6+ because there is nothing WOW about it. As you both have said, it''s a nice photo but most people won''t know this is Hak "The Hammer" Goldberg from EPSN. He''s a Horse Race Analyst. He puts up his picks before each race. God help you if you made the same picks! At least on TV he''s not that good. EPSN used to run a segment called The Longshot before each race sponsored by Budweiser. That was another, geez, I hope I didn''t pick that one. It never came in, hence the longshot, but the horses they picked weren''t all that bad. Finally though they had two of them come in in a span of a few months and it was no longer taboo.<br/> <br/>Bottom line, I''m going to need to be even more pedestrian to get that Ribbon without entering something just completely horrible. Thanks for the kind words!</td>', 'This is defintely not a Bottom 10 finish but this is DPC and I''m determined to continue to enter images that meet the challenge and fight for that coveted Brown Ribbon! I''ve come close the last few challenges. I knew this wouldn''t score well as in 6+ because there is nothing WOW about it. As you both have said, it''s a nice photo but most people won''t know this is Hak "The Hammer" Goldberg from EPSN. He''s a Horse Race Analyst. He puts up his picks before each race. God help you if you made the same picks! At least on TV he''s not that good. EPSN used to run a segment called The Longshot before each race sponsored by Budweiser. That was another, geez, I hope I didn''t pick that one. It never came in, hence the longshot, but the horses they picked weren''t all that bad. Finally though they had two of them come in in a span of a few months and it was no longer taboo. Bottom line, I''m going to need to be even more pedestrian to get that Ribbon without entering something just completely horrible. Thanks for the kind words!', '2009-08-06 18:21:40.000000', NULL, 0),
