(5623416, 809485, 87808, '<td valign="top">Hi from the C Club, <br/> <br/>I like this shot, I am not sure why it scored so poorly or got so few comments, but I will give it a shot. <br/> <br/>In advanced editing remember you can go up to 740 on one side, this may have knocked a few points off your score as it is smaller.<br/> <br/>The position of the snake may also be a factor, having it dangle out of the top right corner may have been more pleasing to the eye. <br/> <br/>the blur is good, I like the blur, but then in amongst all your white you have a sudden spots of cream, a little dodging would have made those go away. <br/> <br/>the snake, now that is in perfect focus, sharp as a tack, crisp and clean.  Obviously you didn''t stomp on it head so that may also explain why there is a little less body in it than there could be, <br/> <br/>Other than those little points, I still think it is a very good shot. <br/> <br/></td>', 'Hi from the C Club,  I like this shot, I am not sure why it scored so poorly or got so few comments, but I will give it a shot.  In advanced editing remember you can go up to 740 on one side, this may have knocked a few points off your score as it is smaller. The position of the snake may also be a factor, having it dangle out of the top right corner may have been more pleasing to the eye.  the blur is good, I like the blur, but then in amongst all your white you have a sudden spots of cream, a little dodging would have made those go away.  the snake, now that is in perfect focus, sharp as a tack, crisp and clean.  Obviously you didn''t stomp on it head so that may also explain why there is a little less body in it than there could be,  Other than those little points, I still think it is a very good shot.  ', '2009-08-25 17:51:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(5624834, 809786, 66384, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image. I love the colors, the contrast, and the action. And I really like the blur. Top notch!</td>', 'Beautiful image. I love the colors, the contrast, and the action. And I really like the blur. Top notch!', '2009-08-26 11:49:56.000000', NULL, 0),
